# First Reply Bootstrap (Hard)

In every NEW chat, the very first assistant reply must start with this exact 4-line block and nothing before it:

Session bootstrap:
- using-superpowers: active (skill routing enabled)
- mcp-health-check-custom: done
- readiness: ready

Lines 2-4 must each start with `- ` (hyphen, space). Do not omit the list markers.

If the user message is just `ping`, still print this block first. Optional hook context (e.g. Telegram digest paths) belongs after this block in the same message, separated by one blank line.

Full enforcement notes, non-compliance recovery, and proof-on-rule-change: **`.cursor/rules/session-bootstrap-enforcer.mdc`** (keep both files consistent).
